      <!-- 1. Overview -->
      <h2 id="overview" class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">1. Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
        KnowVerse Inc. ("KnowVerse", "we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting
        your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your
        information when you use our AI-powered knowledge management platform ("Service").
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
        This policy applies to information collected through our website, applications, and services.
        By using KnowVerse, you consent to the data practices described in this policy.
      </p>

      <!-- 2. Information We Collect -->
      <h2 id="information-collected" class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 mb-4">
        <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Name, email address, organization name, job title</li>
        <li><strong>Profile Information:</strong> Avatar, preferences, notification settings</li>
        <li><strong>Documents:</strong> Files you upload (PDFs, Word documents, spreadsheets, etc.)</li>
        <li><strong>Search Queries:</strong> Questions and search terms you enter</li>
        <li><strong>Feedback:</strong> Ratings, comments, and support requests</li>
        <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Billing address, payment method (processed by Stripe)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">2.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 mb-4">
        <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, device identifiers</li>
        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, features used, time spent, click patterns</li>
        <li><strong>Log Data:</strong> Access times, referring URLs, error logs</li>
        <li><strong>Performance Data:</strong> Load times, search latency, API response times</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">2.3 Information from Third Parties</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 mb-4">
        <li><strong>SSO Providers:</strong> Name, email from identity providers (Okta, Azure AD, Google Workspace)</li>
        <li><strong>Connected Services:</strong> Document metadata from Google Drive, Notion</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Aggregated usage data from analytics providers</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- 3. How We Use Your Information -->
      <h2 id="how-we-use" class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">We use your information for the following purposes:</p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">3.1 Service Delivery</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 mb-4">
        <li>Process and store your documents for search and retrieval</li>
        <li>Generate vector embeddings for semantic search</li>
        <li>Provide AI-powered question answering (RAG)</li>
        <li>Authenticate and authorize access to your account</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">3.2 Service Improvement</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 mb-4">
        <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve features</li>
        <li>Debug and fix technical issues</li>
        <li>Develop new features based on user feedback</li>
        <li>Optimize search accuracy and performance</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">3.3 Communication</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 mb-4">
        <li>Send transactional emails (magic links, password resets)</li>
        <li>Notify you of service updates and maintenance</li>
        <li>Respond to support requests</li>
        <li>Send marketing communications (with your consent)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">3.4 Security and Compliance</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 mb-4">
        <li>Detect and prevent fraud and abuse</li>
        <li>Enforce our Terms of Service</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        <li>Protect rights and safety of users</li>
      </ul>

